# Netlify Redirects Configuration for Dhatwal Ki Awaaz (DKA) TTS Studio
# Forward API requests to Netlify Serverless Functions
/api/health            /.netlify/functions/health           200
/api/tts               /.netlify/functions/tts              200
/api/translate-script  /.netlify/functions/translate-script 200
/api/*                 /.netlify/functions/:splat           200

# Single Page App routing: rewrite all other routes to index.html
/*                     /index.html                          200
